~ start_cow_pasture_box

Pasture Box:[[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], your animals are hungry.
Pasture Box: Would you like to feed your cow?
- Yes
	Marlow: Yeah! Lets feed my cows.
	do GameDialogueManager.action_feed_animals()
- No
	Marlow: No, I don't need to feed them.
=> END

~ start_chicken_pasture_box

Pasture Box:[[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], your animals are hungry.
Pasture Box: Would you like to feed your chickens?
- Yes
	Marlow: Yeah! Lets feed them.
	do GameDialogueManager.action_feed_animals()
- No
	Marlow: No, I don't need to feed them.
=> END

~ start_shop
Shopkeeper: Welcome! Are you looking to buy some fresh seeds, or are you looking to sell your harvested goods?
- Open Buying Shop
	=> buy_menu
- Open Selling Shop
	=> sell_menu
- Leave
	Shopkeeper: Happy farming!
=> END

~ buy_menu
Shopkeeper: What seeds do you need?
- Buy Corn Seeds (25 Gold each)
	Shopkeeper: How many Corn Seeds would you like?
	- Buy 1 Corn Seed (25 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.buy_seeds("corn_seeds", DataTypes.Tools.PlantCorn, 25, 1):
			Shopkeeper: Excellent! Added to your tool panel.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: Sorry, you don't have enough gold!
		=> start_shop
	- Buy 10 Corn Seeds (250 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.buy_seeds("corn_seeds", DataTypes.Tools.PlantCorn, 25, 10):
			Shopkeeper: Splendid! 10 Corn Seeds added to your tool panel.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: Sorry, you don't have enough gold!
		=> start_shop
	- Go Back
		=> buy_menu

- Buy Tomato Seeds (30 Gold each)
	Shopkeeper: How many Tomato Seeds would you like?
	- Buy 1 Tomato Seed (30 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.buy_seeds("tomato_seeds", DataTypes.Tools.PlantTomato, 30, 1):
			Shopkeeper: There you go! Ready for tilling.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: Sorry, you don't have enough gold!
		=> start_shop
	- Buy 10 Tomato Seeds (300 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.buy_seeds("tomato_seeds", DataTypes.Tools.PlantTomato, 30, 10):
			Shopkeeper: Double checks out! 10 Tomato Seeds added.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: Sorry, you don't have enough gold!
		=> start_shop
	- Go Back
		=> buy_menu

- Back to Main Menu
	=> start_shop

~ sell_menu
Shopkeeper: I'm buying all kinds of farm goods today. What are you looking to unload?
- Sell Raw Resources (Log / Stone)
	=> sell_resources
- Sell Harvested Crops (Corn / Tomato)
	=> sell_crops
- Sell Animal Products (Milk / Egg)
	=> sell_animals
- Back to Main Menu
	=> start_shop

~ sell_resources
Shopkeeper: Looking to unload some materials?
- Sell Logs (Gets 10 Gold each)
	Shopkeeper: How many Logs do you want to sell?
	- Sell 1 Log (+10 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("log", 10, 1):
			Shopkeeper: Perfect, thank you for the wood!
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Logs in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Sell 10 Logs (+100 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("log", 10, 10):
			Shopkeeper: Great haul! Here is your gold.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Logs in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Go Back
		=> sell_resources

- Sell Stone (Gets 12 Gold each)
	Shopkeeper: How much Stone do you want to sell?
	- Sell 1 Stone (+12 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("stone", 12, 1):
			Shopkeeper: Thanks! Hard rock is always useful.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Stone in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Sell 10 Stone (+120 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("stone", 12, 10):
			Shopkeeper: Fantastic! This will make a sturdy foundation.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Stone in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Go Back
		=> sell_resources

- Go Back
	=> sell_menu

~ sell_crops
Shopkeeper: Fresh out of the fields, eh? Let me see what you've got.
- Sell Corn (Gets 40 Gold each)
	Shopkeeper: How much Corn do you want to sell?
	- Sell 1 Corn (+40 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("corn", 40, 1):
			Shopkeeper: Sweet corn! The town will love this.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Corn in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Sell 10 Corn (+400 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("corn", 40, 10):
			Shopkeeper: Awesome bundle! Here is your gold.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Corn in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Go Back
		=> sell_crops

- Sell Tomato (Gets 50 Gold each)
	Shopkeeper: How many Tomatoes do you want to sell?
	- Sell 1 Tomato (+50 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("tomato", 50, 1):
			Shopkeeper: Nice and ripe! Thanks.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Tomatoes in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Sell 10 Tomatoes (+500 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("tomato", 50, 10):
			Shopkeeper: Perfect shipment. Here is your payment!
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Tomatoes in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Go Back
		=> sell_crops

- Go Back
	=> sell_menu

~ sell_animals
Shopkeeper: Ah, fresh products straight from your barn!
- Sell Milk (Gets 60 Gold each)
	Shopkeeper: How much Milk do you want to sell?
	- Sell 1 Milk (+60 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("milk", 60, 1):
			Shopkeeper: Fresh milk! Perfect.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Milk in your inventory!
		=> start_shop
	- Sell 10 Milk (+600 Gold)
		if InventoryManager.current_shop != null and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item("milk", 60, 10):
			Shopkeeper: Splendid dairy haul! Here is your money.
		else:
			Shopkeeper: You don't have enough Milk in your inventory!
